            <title>3.15.1</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 13:03:52 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>184</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.15.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Forking a conversation in a pane that shows another Mac's session now opens the fork in a new pane, as it already did for this Mac's sessions, instead of replacing the conversation. The fork runs on that Mac, titled "<original> (fork)", with the forked message in its composer. It starts with that Mac's default model and permission mode.
- Starting a new conversation from such a pane opens it in a new pane, in the same folder on that Mac.
]]></description>
